    "reviewTitle": "How do you like that? It works!!!",
    "reviewDescription": "This stuff actually works! I have to say, I was skeptical, having tried other things for my RLS, but when I read other reviews that said it worked for others, I decided to give it a try. The first night I put it on my calves, my RLS tingles stopped for about 30 minutes but then started up again. However, the second night I put it on, my RLS went away and stayed away! I couldn't believe it! I've now been using it every night since for the past few weeks and, while my RLS symptoms are not 100% gone, it's way, way down and much easier for me to fall asleep again. I experimented by not putting it on one night to see what would happen and, sure enough, my RLS started up again soon after lying down in bed! I'm going to experiment next with putting more cream on my left leg, as that one seems to have stronger symptoms than my right leg. But overall, I'm very pleased with this cream and plan to continue using it. I also like the consistency of the cream because it's light and absorbs easily into my skin so doesn't get on my sheets at all. The lavendar scent is very faint. I actually love lavendar so I wouldn't mind if it was stronger. Overall, I would recommend this for others with RLS as it works for me and I hope it does for you too because RLS is no fun!",
